The Swift code bundling feature reimplemented here, and several of the
supporting utilities, follow SKIE's design and in places its code. Every file
containing derived code carries a header naming the SKIE source files it is
based on and stating how it was changed. The files concerned are:

    plugin-build/compiler-plugin/src/main/kotlin/io/github/frankois944/kmpSwiftCodeBundling/compiler/
        Command.kt
        FrameworkLayout.kt
        PhaseBodyInterception.kt
        RelativeSourcePathsWorkaround.kt
        SwiftBundlingLinkerStep.kt
        TargetTriple.kt

    plugin-build/plugin/src/main/java/io/github/frankois944/kmpSwiftCodeBundling/
        ProcessSwiftSourcesTask.kt
        SwiftCodeBundlingExtension.kt
        UnpackSwiftSourcesTask.kt
        internal/BundleSwiftSourcesIntoKlib.kt
        internal/DirectorySync.kt
        internal/Names.kt
        internal/SwiftCodeBundlingConfigurator.kt
        internal/Zip.kt

